1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The SDR role is not disappearing.

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,370
It is being redesigned around AI.

3
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,910
The version of the SDR role that AI

4
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:09,900
replaces is the one built around volume.

5
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:11,780
Sending hundreds of emails.

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,480
Making dozens of calls.

7
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,660
Hoping that enough activity produces

8
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:16,670
enough pipeline.

9
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:19,390
That model was already broken before AI.

10
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:21,830
AI accelerates its obsolescence.

11
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,980
The SDR role that survives and scales is

12
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,120
built around judgment.

13
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,700
Which accounts are worth pursuing right

14
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:28,920
now.

15
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:31,560
Which message will resonate with this

16
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:32,370
specific buyer.

17
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,340
Which signal indicates genuine intent

18
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,160
versus noise.

19
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,710
AI handles the research, the sequencing,

20
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:41,810
and the personalization at scale.

21
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,990
The SDR applies judgment to

22
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,370
prioritization, conversation, and

23
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:47,230
qualification.

24
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:49,940
The output is not fewer SDRs doing more

25
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:50,430
volume.

26
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,820
It is fewer SDRs generating better

27
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,740
pipeline because they are spending their

28
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:57,000
time on the work that actually requires

29
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:57,480
a human.

30
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,670
The teams that figure this out first

31
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,080
will have a structural advantage in

32
00:01:01,130 --> 00:01:02,030
pipeline generation.

33
00:01:02,470 --> 00:01:04,270
The ones that do not will keep hiring

34
00:01:04,310 --> 00:01:06,370
for volume and wondering why conversion

35
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:07,390
rates are not improving.

36
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:10,940
Follow A-Gent for the agent-first GTM

37
00:01:10,990 --> 00:01:11,420
playbook.
